"Screen filter mode (experimental)" = "屏幕滤镜模式（实验性）";
"The game starts unchanged: no copy, nothing injected. MacShade captures the game window and shows it with ReShade on top. This works for games MacShade cannot hook (Metal, Mac App Store, copy protection, Intel-only games). Costs one or two frames of delay, no depth effects. Needs the Screen Recording permission; works best in a window or borderless." = "游戏保持原样启动：不复制、不注入。MacShade 捕获游戏窗口，并在其上叠加 ReShade。适用于 MacShade 无法挂钩的游戏（Metal、Mac App Store、版权保护、仅 Intel 的游戏）。会有一到两帧延迟，无深度效果。需要屏幕录制权限；窗口或无边框模式效果最佳。";
