"Only used in the screen filter mode: when ReShade cannot keep up, the capture size drops in steps (100 %, 90 %, 75 %) and returns when there is room again. The picture gets slightly softer and flickers briefly at each change. Not combined with half resolution. Takes effect at the next start." = "仅用于屏幕滤镜模式：当 ReShade 跟不上时，捕获尺寸会分档下降（100 %、90 %、75 %），有余量时再回升。画面会略微变软，每次切换时短暂闪烁。不能与半分辨率同时使用。下次启动时生效。";
